TY  - JOUR
TI  - A data-based opportunity identification engine for collaborative freight logistics based on a trailer capacity graph
T2  - Expert Systems with Applications
J2  - Expert Sys Appl
VL  - 210
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1016/j.eswa.2022.118494
SN  - 09574174 (ISSN) 
AU  - Luan, J.
