TY  - JOUR
TI  - Performance evaluation of in-source ion activation hardware for collision-induced unfolding of proteins and protein complexes on a drift tube ion mobility-mass spectrometer
T2  - Analyst
J2  - Analyst
VL  - 148
IS  - 2
SP  - 391
EP  - 401
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1039/d2an01452a
SN  - 00032654 (ISSN) 
AU  - Gadkari, V.V.
AU  - Juliano, B.R.
AU  - Mallis, C.S.
AU  - May, J.C.
AU  - Kurulugama, R.T.
AU  - Fjeldsted, J.C.
