TI  - Software Application Profile: SUMnlmr, an R package that facilitates flexible and reproducible non-linear Mendelian randomization analyses
T2  - International Journal of Epidemiology
J2  - Int. J. Epidemiol.
VL  - 51
IS  - 6
SP  - 2014
EP  - 2019
PY  - 2022
