TY  - JOUR
TI  - Replication of neural responses to monetary incentives and exploration of reward-influenced network connectivity in fibromyalgia
T2  - Neuroimage: Reports
J2  - Neuroimage
VL  - 2
IS  - 4
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1016/j.ynirp.2022.100147
