TI  - Effect of colonisation with Neisseria lactamica on cross-reactive anti-meningococcal B-cell responses: a randomised, controlled, human infection trial
T2  - The Lancet Microbe
J2  - Lancet Micr.
VL  - 3
IS  - 12
SP  - e931
EP  - e943
PY  - 2022
