TY  - JOUR
TI  - Objective hearing threshold identification from auditory brainstem response measurements using supervised and self-supervised approaches
T2  - BMC Neuroscience
J2  - BMC Neurosci.
VL  - 23
IS  - 1
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1186/s12868-022-00758-0
SN  - 14712202 (ISSN) 
AU  - Thalmeier, D.
