TY  - JOUR
TI  - A cross-sectional study of the prevalence, barriers, and facilitators of cervical cancer screening in family planning clinics in Mombasa County, Kenya
T2  - BMC Health Services Research
J2  - BMC Health Serv. Res.
VL  - 22
IS  - 1
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1186/s12913-022-08984-2
SN  - 14726963 (ISSN) 
