TI  - Methods for development and application of data standards in an ontology-driven information model for measuring, managing, and computing social determinants of health for individuals, households, and communities evaluated through an example of asthma
T2  - Journal of Biomedical Informatics
J2  - J. Biomed. Informatics
VL  - 136
