TY  - JOUR
TI  - A comparison between the clinical frailty scale and the hospital frailty risk score to risk stratify older people with emergency care needs
T2  - BMC Emergency Medicine
J2  - BMC Emerg. Med.
VL  - 22
IS  - 1
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1186/s12873-022-00730-5
SN  - 1471227X (ISSN) 
