TI  - Implementation of machine learning in the clinic: challenges and lessons in prospective deployment from the System for High Intensity EvaLuation During Radiation Therapy (SHIELD-RT) randomized controlled study
T2  - BMC Bioinformatics
J2  - BMC Bioinform.
