TY  - JOUR
TI  - Source Term Analysis of Xenon (STAX): An effort focused on differentiating man-made isotope production from nuclear explosions via stack monitoring
T2  - Journal of Environmental Radioactivity
J2  - J. Environ. Radioact.
VL  - 255
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1016/j.jenvrad.2022.107037
SN  - 0265931X (ISSN) 
