TY  - JOUR
TI  - One-off events? An empirical study of hackathon code creation and reuse
T2  - Empirical Software Engineering
J2  - Empir Software Eng
VL  - 27
IS  - 7
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1007/s10664-022-10201-x
