TY  - JOUR
TI  - Nested and multipart prospective observational studies, flaming fiasco or efficiently economical?: The Brain, Bone, Heart case study
T2  - BMC Medical Research Methodology
J2  - BMC Med. Res. Methodol.
VL  - 22
IS  - 1
PY  - 2022
