TY  - JOUR
TI  - Changing the culture: a qualitative study exploring research capacity in local government
T2  - BMC Public Health
J2  - BMC Public Health
VL  - 22
IS  - 1
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1186/s12889-022-13758-w
SN  - 14712458 (ISSN) 
