AU  - Mullen, S.
AD  - Sport and Physical Activity Research Centre, Sheffield Hallam University, Olympic Legacy Park, 2 Old Hall Road, Sheffield, S9 3TU, United Kingdom
AD  - School of Health, Leeds Beckett University, Portland Building, Leeds, LS1 3HE, United Kingdom
