TY  - JOUR
TI  - “They Show Us that We’re Important”: Facilitators of Service Utilization Among Expectant and Parenting Youth with Foster Care Histories
T2  - Child and Adolescent Social Work Journal
J2  - Child Adolesc. Soc. Work J.
VL  - 39
