TY  - JOUR
TI  - What is the state of children’s participation in qualitative research on health interventions?: a scoping study
T2  - BMC Pediatrics
J2  - BMC Pediatr.
VL  - 22
IS  - 1
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1186/s12887-022-03391-2
SN  - 14712431 (ISSN) 
