TY  - JOUR
TI  - Incidence of Cutaneous Adverse Events with Phosphoinositide 3-Kinase Inhibitors as Adjuvant Therapy in Patients with Cancer: A Systematic Review and Meta-analysis
T2  - JAMA Oncology
J2  - JAMA Oncol.
VL  - 8
IS  - 11
SP  - 1635
EP  - 1643
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1001/jamaoncol.2022.4327
