TY  - JOUR
TI  - Improving Documentation of Postdischarge Issue Mitigation during Postdischarge Phone Calls
T2  - Pediatric Quality and Safety
J2  - Pediatr. Qual. Saf.
VL  - 7
IS  - 6
SP  - E618
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1097/pq9.0000000000000618
