TY  - JOUR
TI  - The ethical underpinnings of Smart City governance: Decision-making in the Smart Cambridge programme, UK
T2  - Urban Studies
J2  - Urban Stud.
VL  - 59
IS  - 14
SP  - 2968
EP  - 2984
PY  - 2022
