TI  - Standards for Evaluating Impact in Entrepreneurship Education Research: Using a Descriptive Validity Framework to Enhance Methodological Rigor and Transparency
T2  - Entrepreneurship: Theory and Practice
J2  - Entrep. Theory Pract.
VL  - 46
IS  - 6
SP  - 1685
EP  - 1716
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1177/10422587211018184
