N1  - Funding text 2: This research study is funded by the National Institutes for Health (R01LM012836). All study-related equipment, devices, procedures and BL and DL treatments will be provided to participants at no cost. Participant insurance will not be billed. This study uses text messaging to deliver notifications, reminders and study questionnaires. Standard message and data rates from the participant’s wireless carrier may apply to the study participant. Study participants will not be compensated for any costs related to data usage or sending or receiving text messages by the study or by members of the study team.
