TY  - JOUR
TI  - Interventional compared with medical management of symptomatic carotid web: A systematic review
T2  - Journal of Stroke and Cerebrovascular Diseases
J2  - J. Stroke Cerebrovasc. Dis.
VL  - 31
IS  - 10
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1016/j.jstrokecerebrovasdis.2022.106682
SN  - 10523057 (ISSN) 
AU  - Patel, S.D.
AU  - Otite, F.O.
AU  - Topiwala, K.
