AB  - OMiCC (OMics Compendia Commons) is a biologist-friendly web platform that facilitates data reuse and integration. Users can search over 40,000 publicly available gene expression studies, annotate and curate samples, and perform meta-analysis. Since the initial publication, we have incorporated RNA-seq datasets, compendia sharing, RESTful API support, and an additional meta-analysis method based on random effects. Here, we provide a step-by-step guide for using OMiCC. For complete details on the use and execution of this protocol, please refer to Shah et al. (2016). © 2022
