TY  - JOUR
TI  - Pilot study of physiotherapist-led versus music therapist-led breathing control exercises for young adults living with breathing pattern disorder: a randomised controlled trial protocol
T2  - BMJ Open Respiratory Research
J2  - BMJ Open Respir. Res.
