TI  - Evaluation of the Thermo Scientific SureTectTM Listeria Species PCR Assay in a Broad Range of Foods and Selected Environmental Surfaces: Pre-Collaborative and Collaborative Study, First Action 2021.06
T2  - Journal of AOAC International
