TI  - Climate and genetic data enhancement using deep learning analytics to improve maize yield predictability
T2  - Journal of Experimental Botany
J2  - J. Exp. Bot.
VL  - 73
IS  - 15
SP  - 5336
EP  - 5354
PY  - 2022
