AD  - Southeast Fisheries Science Center, National Marine Fisheries Service, 101 Pivers Island Road, Beaufort, NC  28516, United States
AD  - Virginia Institute of Marine Science, William & Mary, P.O. Box 1346, Gloucester Point, VA  23062, United States
