TY  - JOUR
TI  - Effectiveness of electroconvulsive therapy in patients lacking decision making capacity: A systematic review and meta-analysis
T2  - Brain Stimulation
J2  - Brain Stimul.
VL  - 15
IS  - 5
SP  - 1246
EP  - 1253
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1016/j.brs.2022.09.001
SN  - 1935861X (ISSN) 
AU  - Takamiya, A.
AU  - Sienaert, P.
AU  - Gergel, T.
