TI  - Clinical nurse specialist role in providing generalist and specialist palliative care: A qualitative study of mesothelioma clinical nurse specialists
T2  - Journal of Advanced Nursing
J2  - J. Adv. Nurs.
VL  - 78
IS  - 9
SP  - 2973
EP  - 2982
PY  - 2022
