TI  - A qualitative study of effective collaboration among nurse home visitors, healthcare providers and community support services in the United States
T2  - Health and Social Care in the Community
J2  - Health Soc. Care Community
VL  - 30
IS  - 5
SP  - 1881
EP  - 1893
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1111/hsc.13567
SN  - 09660410 (ISSN) 
AU  - Williams, V.N.
AU  - McManus, B.M.
AU  - Brooks-Russell, A.
AU  - Yost, E.
AU  - Allison, M.A.
AU  - Olds, D.L.
AU  - Tung, G.J.
AD  - Prevention Research Center for Family & Child Health, University of Colorado Anschutz Medical Campus, Aurora, CO, United States
AD  - Department of Health Systems, Management & Policy, Colorado School of Public Health, Aurora, CO, United States
AD  - Department of Community & Behavioral Health, Colorado School of Public Health, Aurora, CO, United States
