TI  - Religious leaders can motivate men to cede power and reduce intimate partner violence: Experimental evidence from Uganda
T2  - Proceedings of the National Academy of Sciences of the United States of America
J2  - Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. U. S. A.
VL  - 119
IS  - 31
