TY  - JOUR
TI  - Evaluating the Management of chronic Pelvic girdle Pain following pregnancy (EMaPP): study protocol for a randomised controlled feasibility trial to compare a customised pelvic orthosis with standard care
T2  - BMJ Open
J2  - BMJ Open
VL  - 12
IS  - 8
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1136/bmjopen-2022-063767
