TI  - The impact of nurse practice environment on patient outcomes and mediation effects of registered nurse outcomes in Middle Eastern acute care hospitals: A cross-sectional study
T2  - Applied Nursing Research
J2  - Appl. Nurs. Res.
VL  - 66
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1016/j.apnr.2022.151605
SN  - 08971897 (ISSN) 
AU  - Almotairy, M.M.
AU  - Hoffart, N.
