TY  - JOUR
TI  - CloudFAS: Cloud-based building fire alarm system using Building Information Modelling
T2  - Journal of Building Engineering
J2  - J. Build. Eng.
VL  - 53
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1016/j.jobe.2022.104571
SN  - 23527102 (ISSN) 
AU  - Zhou, X.
