N1  - Funding text 1: The authors thank the participants who generously contributed their time and experiences to this study, and persons with arthritis (mostly members of Arthritis Research Canada's Arthritis Patient Advisory Board) who shared their perspectives to shape the research questions and interpr. The authors are also grateful for the support of research team members at Arthritis Research Canada, particularly Juliane Chien for her valuable assistance in qualitative analysis. Jenny Leese was supported by a Canadian Institutes of Health Research Doctoral Research Award. Siyi Zhu was funded by the China Scholarship Council Visiting PhD Student Programme (201706240206), National Natural Science Foundation (82002393) and the Health Commission of Sichuan Province (20PJ034). Linda C. Li holds the Harold Robinson/Arthritis Society Chair in Arthritic Diseases award, and is supported by the Canada Research Chair Programme.
