TI  - Effects of Nurse-Led Fall Prevention Programs for Older Adults: A Systematic Review
T2  - Pacific Rim International Journal of Nursing Research
J2  - Pacific Rim Intl. J. Nurs. Res.
VL  - 26
IS  - 3
SP  - 417
EP  - 431
PY  - 2022
