TY  - JOUR
TI  - Characterizing Medicine Quality by Active Pharmaceutical Ingredient Levels: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis across Low- And Middle-Income Countries
T2  - American Journal of Tropical Medicine and Hygiene
J2  - Am. J. Trop. Med. Hyg.
VL  - 106
IS  - 6
