TI  - Personalised Оne Step Melanoma Surgery and the Outdated/Current Guidelines for Surgical Treatment of Cutaneous Melanoma: Facts and Controversies
T2  - Acta Medica Bulgarica
J2  - Acta Med. Bulg.
VL  - 49
