TI  - Experiences of Community Members Engaged in eCPR (Emotional Connecting, Empowering, Revitalizing) Training: Qualitative Focus Group Study
T2  - JMIR Formative Research
J2  - JMIR Form. Res.
VL  - 6
IS  - 6
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.2196/32219
SN  - 2561326X (ISSN) 
AU  - Myers, A.L.
AU  - Mbao, M.
AU  - Kadakia, A.
