TI  - TRUST, THE PANDEMIC, AND PUBLIC POLICIES
T2  - National Tax Journal
J2  - Natl. Tax J.
VL  - 75
IS  - 2
SP  - 355
EP  - 370
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1086/719420
