TI  - Biomarkers as predictors of recurrence of atrial fibrillation post ablation: an updated and expanded systematic review and meta-analysis
T2  - Clinical Research in Cardiology
J2  - Clin. Res. Cardiol.
VL  - 111
IS  - 6
