TI  - There's an app for that: Teaching residents to communicate diagnostic uncertainty through a mobile gaming application
T2  - Patient Education and Counseling
J2  - Patient Educ. Couns.
VL  - 105
IS  - 6
SP  - 1463
EP  - 1469
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1016/j.pec.2021.09.038
SN  - 07383991 (ISSN) 
AU  - McCarthy, D.M.
AU  - Formella, K.T.
AU  - Ou, E.Z.
