TI  - Predictors of refraction prediction error after cataract surgery: a shared parameter model to account for missing post-operative measurements
T2  - Statistical Methods and Applications
J2  - Stat. Methods and Appl.
VL  - 31
IS  - 2
SP  - 343
EP  - 364
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1007/s10260-021-00570-w
