TI  - Multicentre, randomised controlled feasibility study to compare a 10-week physiotherapy programme using an interactive exercise training device to improve walking and balance, to usual care of children with cerebral palsy aged 4-18 years: the ACCEPT study protocol
T2  - BMJ Open
J2  - BMJ Open
VL  - 12
IS  - 5
PY  - 2022
