TY  - JOUR
TI  - Data availability and sector-specific frameworks restrict drought impact quantification in the Intermountain West
T2  - Wiley Interdisciplinary Reviews: Water
J2  - Wiley Interdiscip. Rev.: Water
VL  - 9
IS  - 3
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1002/wat2.1586
SN  - 20491948 (ISSN) 
AU  - Jennings, K.S.
AU  - Wlostowski, A.N.
AU  - Bash, R.E.
AU  - Burkhardt, J.
