TY  - JOUR
TI  - Cultural variability in appraisal patterns for nine positive emotions
T2  - Journal of Cultural Cognitive Science
J2  - J. C. Cognit. Sci.
VL  - 6
IS  - 1
SP  - 51
EP  - 75
PY  - 2022
