TY  - JOUR
TI  - Chinese infection-control strategies for COVID-19 prevention: A qualitative study with confirmed cases
T2  - Public Health Nursing
J2  - Public Health Nurs.
VL  - 39
IS  - 3
SP  - 683
EP  - 692
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1111/phn.13017
