TY  - JOUR
TI  - A systematic review and synthesis of qualitative and quantitative studies evaluating provider, patient, and health care system-related barriers to diagnostic skin cancer examinations
T2  - Archives of Dermatological Research
J2  - Arch. Dermatol. Res.
