TY  - JOUR
TI  - An Evaluation Framework for Risk of Coastal Marine Ecological Diversity Loss From Land-Based Impacts
T2  - Frontiers in Marine Science
J2  - Front. Mar. Sci.
VL  - 9
PY  - 2022
