TI  - Mental healthcare utilisation by patients before and after receiving paliperidone palmitate treatment: mirror image analyses
T2  - BMJ Open
J2  - BMJ Open
VL  - 12
IS  - 4
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1136/bmjopen-2021-051567
SN  - 20446055 (ISSN) 
