TY  - JOUR
TI  - Linking the Paul Coverdell National Acute Stroke Program to commercial claims to establish a framework for real-world longitudinal stroke research
T2  - Stroke and Vascular Neurology
J2  - Stroke Vasc. Neurol.
VL  - 7
IS  - 2
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1136/SVN-2021-001134
SN  - 20598688 (ISSN) 
AU  - Patorno, E.
AU  - Schneeweiss, S.
AU  - George, M.G.
AU  - Tong, X.
