TI  - A CONSORT-guided, randomized, double-blind, controlled pilot clinical trial of inhaled lidocaine for the treatment of equine asthma
T2  - Canadian Journal of Veterinary Research
J2  - Can. J. Vet. Res.
VL  - 86
IS  - 2
SP  - 116
EP  - 124
PY  - 2022
