AU  - Cheng, C.-Y.
AU  - Wu, Y.-L.
AU  - Lee, J.-D.
AU  - Hsu, C.-Y.
AU  - Ovbiagele, B.
AD  - Department of Neurology, Chang Gung University College of Medicine, Chang Gung Memorial Hospital, Chiayi, Taiwan
