N1  - Funding text 1: The Innovating Teaching and Learning Leadership (iTALL) model () informed our teacher and administrator preparation programs using walkthrough observations as a shared field experience. A walkthrough is a brief 5-10 minutes classroom observation intended to provide informal formative feedback to the teacher (). The higher education program served as internal project evaluators. The University of North Carolina Wilmington funded iTALL through an Applied Research Strategic Initiative Award.
