TI  - Barriers and facilitators of use of analytics for strategic health and care decision-making: A qualitative study of senior health and care leaders' perspectives
T2  - BMJ Open
J2  - BMJ Open
VL  - 12
IS  - 2
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1136/bmjopen-2021-055504
