TI  - Potential impact of encounter patient decision aids on the patient-clinician dialogue: A qualitative study on Dutch and American medical specialists' experiences
T2  - BMJ Open
J2  - BMJ Open
VL  - 12
IS  - 2
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1136/bmjopen-2020-048146
