TI  - Age estimation in humans through the analysis of aspartic acid racemization from teeth: A scoping review of methods, outcomes, and open research questions
T2  - Forensic Science International
J2  - Forensic Sci. Int.
VL  - 331
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1016/j.forsciint.2021.111154
