TI  - Self-Administered Six-Minute Walk Test Using a Free Smartphone App in Asymptomatic Adults: Reliability and Reproducibility
T2  - International Journal of Environmental Research and Public Health
J2  - Int. J. Environ. Res. Public Health
VL  - 19
IS  - 3
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.3390/ijerph19031118
