TY  - JOUR
TI  - Opportunities and challenges for solid waste reuse and recycling in emerging economies: A hybrid analysis
T2  - Resources, Conservation and Recycling
J2  - Resour. Conserv. Recycl.
VL  - 177
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1016/j.resconrec.2021.105968
SN  - 09213449 (ISSN) 
