AB  - This contribution is an artistic intervention, a pedagogic invitation, and a statement against the immobilizing workings of borders. Through an engagement with feminist theory, movement practices and pedagogy, I propose movement as a tactic to inhabit borders and space and make them yield to our bodies and trajectories. © 2023 Women & Performance Project Inc.
