TI  - TVIR: a comprehensive vegetable information resource database for comparative and functional genomic studies
T2  - Horticulture Research
J2  - Hortic. Res.
VL  - 9
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1093/hr/uhac213
SN  - 26626810 (ISSN) 
