TI  - BabyX: Transferring 3D facial expressions from adults to children
T2  - Journal of WSCG
J2  - J. WSCG
VL  - 2022
SP  - 109
EP  - 118
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.24132/CSRN.3201.14
