TI  - Interval Privacy: A Framework for Privacy-Preserving Data Collection
T2  - IEEE Transactions on Signal Processing
J2  - IEEE Trans Signal Process
VL  - 70
SP  - 2443
EP  - 2459
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1109/TSP.2022.3169432
