TI  - “Getting Started”: A Pilot Introductory Narrative Writing Session for Interprofessional Faculty in Academic Health Sciences
T2  - Advances in Medical Education and Practice
J2  - Adv. Med. Edu. Pract.
VL  - 13
SP  - 265
EP  - 274
PY  - 2022
