TY  - JOUR
TI  - A FULLY BAYESIAN GRADIENT-FREE SUPERVISED DIMENSION REDUCTION METHOD USING GAUSSIAN PROCESSES
T2  - International Journal for Uncertainty Quantification
J2  - Int. J. Uncertain. Quantif.
VL  - 12
IS  - 2
SP  - 19
EP  - 51
PY  - 2022
