TY  - JOUR
TI  - Cloud service recommendation for small and medium-sized enterprises: A context-Aware group decision making approach
T2  - Journal of Intelligent and Fuzzy Systems
J2  - J. Intelligent Fuzzy Syst.
VL  - 42
IS  - 3
SP  - 1331
EP  - 1351
PY  - 2022
