TI  - Collaborative Research and Development of a Novel, Patient-Centered Digital Platform (MyEyeSite) for Rare Inherited Retinal Disease Data: Acceptability and Feasibility Study
T2  - JMIR Formative Research
J2  - JMIR Form. Res.
VL  - 6
IS  - 1
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.2196/21341
SN  - 2561326X (ISSN) 
AU  - Gilbert, R.M.
AU  - Sumodhee, D.
AU  - Pontikos, N.
AU  - Hollyhead, C.
AU  - Patrick, A.
AU  - Scarles, S.
