TY  - JOUR
TI  - A Replicable, Solution-Focused Approach to Cross-Sector Data Sharing for Evaluation of Community Violence Prevention Programming
T2  - Journal of Public Health Management and Practice
J2  - J. Public Health Manage. Pract.
VL  - 28
SP  - S43
EP  - S53
PY  - 2022
