TY  - JOUR
TI  - Social enterprise in prisons: enabling innovation and co-creation
T2  - Public Money and Management
J2  - Pub. Money Manage.
VL  - 42
IS  - 5
SP  - 323
EP  - 331
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1080/09540962.2021.2001202
