TY  - JOUR
TI  - Number and quality of randomized controlled trials in obstetrics published in the top general medical and obstetrics and gynecology journals
T2  - American Journal of Obstetrics and Gynecology MFM
J2  - American J. Obstet. Gynecol. MFM
VL  - 4
