TY  - JOUR
TI  - Limitations of current spatial ability testing for military aviators
T2  - Military Psychology
J2  - Mil. Psychol.
VL  - 34
IS  - 1
SP  - 33
EP  - 46
PY  - 2022
DO  - 10.1080/08995605.2021.1965786
