TI  - GCI: A GPU-Based Transfer Learning Approach for Detecting Cheats of Computer Game
T2  - IEEE Transactions on Dependable and Secure Computing
J2  - IEEE Trans. Dependable Secure Comput.
VL  - 19
IS  - 2
SP  - 804
EP  - 816
